9|0=2|4|17|9|100|0|6|<s_1.3>Rules for *BitbAem*!<s_1>\n\n1. @No Out of Bounds@ for both Ori and abilities.\n2. @No glitches@ (See below). Anything not in the list is OK.\n3. @Debug controls are banned@. $Debug renderer is allowed$.\n4. DBoosting is NEVER REQUIRED for progression. This plando #can be completed hitless#.\n\n<s_1.3>Banned glitches (ongoing list)<s_1>\nAbility Swaps, Backup saving/loading, Buy Anywhere, Cutscene lifts, Dive Launch, Fake Bash(1), Fake Burrow, Godmode, Grenade Zoomies, Hammer Jumps, Pause Floats, QtM to warp or clip into terrain, Sentry Jumps, Wavedashes (Dash/Blaze+Regen)\n\n(1) Fake Bash is only allowed if playing hitless, and only to avoid enemy contact damage.|f=900|instant
9|0=2|4|17|9|100|1|6|<s_1.3>Rules for *BitbAem*!<s_1>\n\n1. @No Out of Bounds@ for both Ori and abilities.\n2. @No glitches@ (See below). Anything not in the list is OK.\n3. @Debug controls are banned@. $Debug renderer is allowed$.\n4. DBoosting is NEVER REQUIRED for progression. This plando #can be completed hitless#.\n5. Hard mode is very hard. You are more than welcome to ask for help :oriHug:\n\n<s_1.3>Banned glitches (ongoing list)<s_1>\nAbility Swaps, Backup saving/loading, Buy Anywhere, Cutscene lifts, Dive Launch, Fake Bash(1), Fake Burrow, Godmode, Grenade Zoomies, Hammer Jumps, Pause Floats, QtM to warp or clip into terrain, Sentry Jumps, Wavedashes (Dash/Blaze+Regen)\n\n(1) Fake Bash is only allowed if playing hitless, and only to avoid enemy contact damage.|f=900|instant
